# Oberlo

> [Oberlo](https://www.oberlo.com) is a free ecommerce and dropshipping education library run by Shopify. It publishes evergreen guides, entrepreneur stories, ebooks, videos, podcast episodes, and ecommerce statistics for people starting and running an online store, plus a small set of free business tools. Oberlo does not sell anything and has no accounts, pricing, or checkout: everything here is reference material.

## Build your Business

- [Build your business](https://www.oberlo.com/build-your-business): Hub for articles, podcasts, videos, and ebooks about the skills needed to start a business, from picking an idea through marketing it.
- [Business ideas](https://www.oberlo.com/build-your-business/business-ideas): Ideas for what business to start and what to sell, for people who want to start but have not picked a direction.
- [Case studies](https://www.oberlo.com/build-your-business/case-studies): Case studies from entrepreneurs who have already built and run a store.
- [Design and branding](https://www.oberlo.com/build-your-business/design-and-branding): Building an ecommerce storefront and a brand customers recognize.
- [Dropshipping](https://www.oberlo.com/build-your-business/dropshipping): How to start a dropshipping business, including what to sell and how to source it.
- [Marketing](https://www.oberlo.com/build-your-business/marketing): Marketing an ecommerce business: channels, campaigns, and growth tactics.

## Entrepreneur Stories

- [Stories](https://www.oberlo.com/stories): Hub for first-hand stories from entrepreneurs, in articles, podcasts, videos, and ebooks.
- [A day in my life](https://www.oberlo.com/stories/a-day-in-my-life): What owning a business actually looks like day to day.
- [My first 90 days](https://www.oberlo.com/stories/my-first-90-days): First-hand accounts of the first three months of a new business.
- [Raise the bar](https://www.oberlo.com/stories/raise-the-bar): Stories from entrepreneurs building businesses that make things better for other people.
- [Starter stories](https://www.oberlo.com/stories/starter-stories): How people got a first business off the ground, and what it took.

## Your Life

- [Your life](https://www.oberlo.com/your-life): Hub for the non-business side of running a business: mindset, wellbeing, productivity, and money.
- [Mindset](https://www.oberlo.com/your-life/mindset): Habits and mental models for staying steady while building a business.
- [Money](https://www.oberlo.com/your-life/money): Personal finance for entrepreneurs: setting money goals, budgeting, and managing income.
- [Productivity](https://www.oberlo.com/your-life/productivity): Routines, focus, and time management for people running their own business.
- [Wellbeing](https://www.oberlo.com/your-life/wellbeing): Avoiding burnout and staying healthy through the grind.

## Resources

- [Blog](https://www.oberlo.com/blog): The main article archive, covering every stage from finding products and building a store to marketing and scaling up.
- [Ebooks](https://www.oberlo.com/ebooks): Free long-form ebooks on ecommerce, marketing, and entrepreneurship, readable chapter by chapter on the site.
- [Ecommerce statistics](https://www.oberlo.com/statistics): A library of ecommerce and dropshipping statistics on topics like ecommerce growth and online shopping trends.
- [Ecommerce wiki](https://www.oberlo.com/ecommerce-wiki): Plain-language definitions of the dropshipping, business, and digital marketing terms used across the site.
- [Videos](https://www.oberlo.com/videos): Video archive covering business ideas through marketing an ecommerce store.
- [Podcast](https://www.oberlo.com/podcast): Start Yours, an ecommerce and dropshipping podcast with interviews and side-hustle advice.
- [Sitemap](https://www.oberlo.com/sitemap): Human-readable index of everything published on Oberlo.

## Free Business Tools

- [Free business tools](https://www.oberlo.com/tools): Index of Oberlo's free tools for naming, pricing, and planning a business.
- [Business name generator](https://www.oberlo.com/tools/business-name-generator): Generate business name ideas for a new brand.
- [Slogan generator](https://www.oberlo.com/tools/slogan-generator): Generate slogan and tagline ideas for a brand.
- [Traffic calculator](https://www.oberlo.com/tools/dropshipping-traffic-calculator): Estimate the traffic a dropshipping store needs to reach a revenue target.
- [Profit margin calculator](https://www.oberlo.com/tools/profit-margin-calculator): Work out selling price and profit margin from product cost.

